   "localStart": 0,
   "localDuration": 4.153,
   "text": "Loop Engineering 全网最全指南，来了。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-2",
   "localStart": 4.153,
   "localDuration": 8.46,
   "text": "我连搞几个通宵，把全网关于 Loop Engineering 的一手材料全部读完，浓缩成今天这一期，一次讲透。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-3",
   "localStart": 12.78,
   "localDuration": 2.719,
   "text": "先说你大概率正处在的状态。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-4",
   "localStart": 15.499,
   "localDuration": 8.159,
   "text": "你现在用 AI 写代码，节奏是这样的：想清楚要做什么，写一段提示词，看它输出。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-5",
   "localStart": 23.658,
   "localDuration": 2.092,
   "text": "不满意，再改提示词。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-6",
   "localStart": 25.75,
   "localDuration": 2.929,
   "text": "但有一群人，已经不这么做了。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-7",
   "localStart": 28.836,
   "localDuration": 7.057,
   "text": "Claude Code 的负责人 Boris Cherny，直接说过这么一句话：我已经不给 Claude 写提示词了。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-8",
   "localStart": 35.893,
   "localDuration": 1.196,
   "text": "我的工作，是写循环。"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-9",
   "localStart": 37.089,
   "localDuration": 2.99,
   "text": "My job is to write loops."
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-10",
   "localStart": 40.248,
   "localDuration": 2.702,
   "text": "这个循环系统，具体长什么样？"
  },
  {
   "id": "sub-11",
   "localStart": 42.95,
   "localDuration": 4.826,
   "text": "与其给你念模块清单，不如带你看一个真实循环的一天。"
  }
 ]
